        <summary>
          <para>An error code that can be reported by onError(CameraDevice, int) indicating that the camera device is in use already.</para>
          <para>This error can be produced when opening the camera fails due to the camera being used by a higher-priority camera API client.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/camera2/CameraDevice.StateCallback#ERROR_CAMERA_IN_USE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.camera2.CameraDevice.StateCallback.ERROR_CAMERA_IN_USE</code>.</a></format></para>
